  "description": "A powerful fat tire eBike built for confident off-pavement exploration, everyday utility, and carrying more along the way.\nThe Batch eAF.1 is a capable fat tire eBike built for riders who want to explore beyond the pavement. Its 750W Shengyi rear hub motor delivers up to 85Nm of torque, providing powerful electric assistance for hills, dirt roads, trails, and other less-traveled routes.\nWide 26\" x 4.0\" tires create a stable, planted ride, while the 80mm suspension fork helps smooth out rough terrain. Tektro hydraulic disc brakes with 180mm rotors provide confident stopping power, and the integrated rear rack makes it easy to bring gear along for the ride.\nWith a 720Wh battery, Shimano drivetrain, and dual-mode front light, the eAF.1 combines off-pavement capability with the practical features riders need for everyday exploration.",
